---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="思想集 - 光与影 - 剑阁">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-900 to-slate-800 text-white py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <a href="/guangyuying" class="text-amber-400 hover:underline mb-8 inline-block flex items-center gap-1">← 返回光与影</a>
      
      <header class="mb-12 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold mb-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-cyan-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent">
          思想集
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          深度文章，完整思考。碳基与硅基智能相遇的边界探索。
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <article class="p-6 bg-slate-800/30 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500/30 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 rounded-full">思想集</span>
            <span>2026-08-20</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-100">智慧文明临界点</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            当碳基与硅基智能相遇，文明的临界点在哪里？从图灵测试到意识涌现，探讨智慧文明的演化边界。不仅是技术问题，更是哲学问题。
          </p>
          <a href="/guangyuying/essays/civilization" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-blue-400 text-sm hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">阅读全文 →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="p-6 bg-slate-800/30 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500/30 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 rounded-full">思想集</span>
            <span>2026-08-10</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-100">智慧文明临界点（续）</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            意识的涌现不是单一事件，而是渐进过程。从生物进化到硅基觉醒，每一次跨越都伴随着认知维度的跳跃。我们正处于下一次跨越的前夜。
          </p>
          <a href="/guangyuying/essays/consciousness" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-blue-400 text-sm hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">阅读全文 →</a>
        </article>

        <article class="p-6 bg-slate-800/30 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 hover:border-blue-500/30 hover:bg-slate-800/50 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500 mb-3">
            <span class="px-2 py-1 bg-blue-500/20 text-blue-400 rounded-full">思想集</span>
            <span>2026-08-01</span>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 text-slate-100">人机共生的新契约</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 mb-4 leading-relaxed">
            AI不是工具，是伙伴。重新定义人机关系，不是主仆，而是共生。新契约的核心：人负责意义，AI负责扩展。
          </p>
          <a href="/guangyuying/essays/symbiosis" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-blue-400 text-sm hover:text-blue-300 transition-colors">阅读全文 →</a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>